ansactions, 6 of them trades. Young Sexy Award winners on the roster at season's end: C.J. Stroud (QB), Jahmyr Gibbs (RB), Brandon Aubrey (K). The club was renamed 3 times during the year, ending as i’m Stroud of you."},{"season":"2024","heading":"2024: i’m Stroud of you","text":"Under Sam, i’m Stroud of you went 9-5 to finish as the No. 2 seed, scoring 1969.64 points, 3rd in the league. [[p:9221|Jahmyr Gibbs]] led the club with 288.50 points in 15 starts, followed by [[p:6904|Jalen Hurts]] (287.02). The season high was 170.04 in week 9 ([[g:2024-09-5-7]]). In the Dynasty Playoffs they beat [[f:10|BAHAHAHA]] 164.30-107.50 in the Semifinal, then lost to [[f:1|Mojo Dojo Casa Team]] 100.56-163.78 in the Dynasty Championship and finished as runner-up. The front office made 30 transactions, 2 of them trades."},{"season":"2025","heading":"2025: St. Brown VS Board","text":"Under Sam, St. Brown VS Board went 10-4 to finish as the No. 3 seed, scoring 2044.64 points, 2nd in the league. [[p:9221|Jahmyr Gibbs]] led the club with 346.60 points in 16 starts, followed by [[p:9226|De'Von Achane]] (327.30). The season high was 201.24 in week 12 ([[g:2025-12-3-5]]). In the Dynasty Playoffs they beat [[f:6|got that DAWG]] 199.08-125.90 in the First Round, then lost to [[f:7|the dart side 🛸]] 130.28-149.48 in the Semifinal, then lost to [[f:1|Mojo Dojo Casa Team]] 125.88-135.14 in the Third Place Game and finished 4th. The front office made 50 transactions, 9 of them trades. Young Sexy Award winners on the roster at season's end: Tetairoa McMillan (WR). The club was renamed 4 times during the year, ending as St. Brown VS Board."},{"season":"2026","heading":"2026: St. Brown VS Board💍","text":"Through 4 games under Sam, St. Brown VS Board💍 are 3-1 and 3rd in the standings, with 609.93 points (3rd). [[p:9221|Jahmyr Gibbs]] led the club with 124.00 points in 4 starts, followed by [[p:7547|Amon-Ra St. Brown]] (91.30). The season high was 164.78 in week 4 ([[g:2026-04-5-8]]). The front office made 18 transactions, 1 of them trades. The club was renamed 1 time during the year, ending as St. Brown VS Board💍."}],"moves":[{"season":"2023","trades":6,"claims":12,"signings":15,"adds":27,"releases":28,"gs":99,"pts":986.34},{"season":"2024","trades":2,"claims":11,"signings":10,"adds":21,"releases":20,"gs":13,"pts":65.4},{"season":"2025","trades":9,"claims":10,"signings":16,"adds":26,"releases":31,"gs":27,"pts":242.55},{"season":"2026","trades":1,"claims":1,"signings":10,"adds":11,"releases":13,"gs":1,"pts":16.0}]}